      "dialogScript": "Walk softly, $name. The dead here do not rest.---I am Memor. I keep the names of all who lie here, so the dream does not forget them.---This is a thin place. The dream wears through here, and what was buried climbs back out. See what stirs among the graves.---The warriors among them carry skulls cracked by something older than this church. Bring me some, and I will learn what wakes them.---Below the tomb lies the crypt, and past it the chamber where the Necromancer keeps the dead from rest. Do not go down alone.",
